message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "themis-ti-mosaic-tools: download, verify and repair the THEMIS-derived global thermal inertia mosaic of Mars"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-12
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/euchas/themis-ti-mosaic-tools"
url: "https://github.com/euchas/themis-ti-mosaic-tools"
authors:
  - family-names: Valantinas
    given-names: Adomas
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9995-3335"
    affiliation: "University of Cambridge"
keywords:
  - Mars
  - THEMIS
  - Mars Odyssey
  - thermal inertia
  - GeoTIFF
  - ISIS
  - USGS Astrogeology
abstract: >-
  Python tools for the USGS/ASU Mars THEMIS-derived global thermal inertia
  mosaic: a resumable, size-verified downloader for the 24 quantitative
  GeoTIFF tiles, a three-way integrity check (TIFF tile index, full decode,
  value envelope) that catches corrupt tiles a byte-size check cannot, and a
  repair step that rebuilds a tile from its intact ISIS cube master.
